tibor-src/xai-sdk-laravel
Unofficial Laravel package for the SpaceXAI PHP client

This repository is not an official xAI or SpaceXAI package.
It depends on tibor-src/xai-sdk-php.

tibor-src/xai-sdk-php is an independent port of the experimental
SpaceXAI TypeScript SDK and is not published or maintained by xAI.
